Those heading out of station and planning a journey via bus, do ensure you are well ahead of the departure timings. Here is a traffic advisory from @acpnortheasttr for travelers. Traffic police will not let buses wait for you; they will be moved.

We hope such measures around Madivala, Silkboard, KRPuram, Peenya, Mysuru Road & Goraguntepalya help. 

